By Vernon Adams / Cyreal, from Google Fonts, embedded verbatim. Licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1: https://openfontlicense.org

3D models — CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain)
---------------------------------------------
Everything under public/apps/object-tile-scroll/models/, by Kenney
(https://kenney.nl) and Quaternius (https://quaternius.com). CC0 requires no
attribution; they are credited anyway in that folder's CREDITS.md.

Food location data — Greater Cleveland Food Bank
------------------------------------------------
apps/pantry/data.json is compiled from the Greater Cleveland Food Bank's public
food locator, cleansed and enriched. The underlying facts are theirs, not mine,
and this repository makes no claim to them. Anyone reusing that file should
check with the GCFB first, and should note that hours change and the data goes
stale.

Libraries loaded at runtime (p5.js, three.js, cannon-es, Bootstrap) are fetched
from public CDNs and are not redistributed here. They keep their own licenses.


